WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.442 --> 00:00:03.357
Unit two. Typing Basics!

2
00:00:04.271 --> 00:00:09.289
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:09.339 --> 00:00:12.575
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.626 --> 00:00:16.591
Today we learn about Typing Basics. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.436 --> 00:00:22.000
Type. Say it with me. Type!

6
00:00:25.563 --> 00:00:29.763
Home row. Say it with me. Home row!

7
00:00:33.223 --> 00:00:36.810
Finger. Say it with me. Finger!

8
00:00:40.282 --> 00:00:44.403
Practice. Say it with me. Practice!

9
00:00:47.955 --> 00:00:52.355
Accuracy. Say it with me. Accuracy!

10
00:00:55.803 --> 00:00:59.637
Speed. Say it with me. Speed!

11
00:01:03.191 --> 00:01:07.718
Backspace. Say it with me. Backspace!

12
00:01:11.195 --> 00:01:15.368
Shift key. Say it with me. Shift key!

13
00:01:18.886 --> 00:01:32.654
I practice typing with my fingers starting on the home row keys. Practice helps me improve my accuracy and speed. I use the backspace key to fix a mistake and the shift key for a capital letter.

14
00:01:32.704 --> 00:01:35.736
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:36.464 --> 00:01:41.895
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:41.945 --> 00:01:43.095
Finger!

17
00:01:44.085 --> 00:01:49.416
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:49.466 --> 00:01:50.676
Backspace!

19
00:01:51.953 --> 00:01:58.517
Did you know? Some fast typists can type over 100 words in just one minute!

20
00:01:58.567 --> 00:02:01.313
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:02.131 --> 00:02:10.959
Think and answer. Why is it helpful to practice typing regularly?

22
00:02:11.009 --> 00:02:12.202
Great answer!

23
00:02:13.293 --> 00:02:19.672
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:19.722 --> 00:02:22.939
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

